  "limits": [
    "Upgrade redirects and complete HTTP response parsing remain open.",
    "Local HTTP callbacks still use the old URL/DNS implementation and a common read-idle policy rather than the source separate streaming and non-streaming deadlines.",
    "The native setup cancellation is prompt rather than waiting for the source five-second task timeout. Native close sends a best-effort frame with a one-second budget and does not reproduce the source close-acknowledgment wait.",
